.SH "NAME"
Docv::Roff::Font \- The four terminal fonts; other font names map onto these.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBenum Docv::Roff::Font\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
The four terminal fonts; other font names map onto these.
.SH "ENUM MEMBERS"
.PP
\fBRegular = 0_u8\fR
.PP
\fBBold = 1_u8\fR
.PP
\fBItalic = 2_u8\fR
.PP
\fBBoldItalic = 3_u8\fR
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.TP 4
\fBdef self.from_name(name : String) : Font\fR
Maps a font name (\fB\%R\fR, \fB\%B\fR, \fB\%I\fR, \fB\%BI\fR, \fB\%CW\fR, \fB\%CB\fR, \fB\%TBI\fR, ...) to a font.
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef attr : Attr\fR
The attributes this font renders with.
